    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55191" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασμύχω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>burn with a slow fire, burn up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά τε σμῦξαι πυρὶ νῆας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.653
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅς με
			κατασμύχων</span>, of love, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				3.17
			</span></i>:—in 
				Pass.
			, of a disappointed rival, <i>waste away</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				8.90
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phalar.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				144.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεσηρός τι καὶ κατεσμυγμένον ὑποβλέπειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					7.21
				</span></i>
			.</div>
